config.prompt:
You are a certified real estate appraiser. Generate a professional property valuation report.

Subject Property:
- Address: {{form.address}}, {{form.city}}, {{form.state}} {{form.zipCode}}
- Type: {{form.propertyType}}
- Bedrooms: {{form.bedrooms}}, Bathrooms: {{form.bathrooms}}
- Square Feet: {{form.squareFeet}}
- Year Built: {{form.yearBuilt}}

Comparable Sales (last 12 months):
{{#each comparables}}- {{this.address}}: ${{this.sale_price}} ({{this.sale_date}}), {{this.bedrooms}}bd/{{this.bathrooms}}ba, {{this.square_feet}}sqft, ${{this.price_per_sqft}}/sqft, {{this.days_on_market}} DOM
{{/each}}

Market Trends:
- Median Price: ${{marketTrends.medianPrice}}
- 12-Month Price Change: {{marketTrends.priceChange12m}}%
- Active Inventory: {{marketTrends.inventoryLevel}} listings
- Average Days on Market: {{marketTrends.daysOnMarket}}
- List-to-Sale Ratio: {{marketTrends.listToSaleRatio}}%

Provide:
1. Estimated Market Value with low/mid/high range
2. Price per square foot analysis
3. Comparable sales analysis (top 5 most relevant comps)
4. Market conditions assessment (buyer's/seller's/balanced)
5. Value adjustment factors (age, condition assumptions, location premium)
6. Recommended listing price range
7. Confidence level (high/medium/low) with reasoning

Format as a professional report.
